# and it silently swallowed tests/fixtures/lineup.json — a test that passes here and fails on
# a fresh clone, for a file nothing warns you about. The real dial stays out of git because it
# carries the household's media paths; the fixture has had them stripped and must be in.
!tests/fixtures/lineup.json

